MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_GymGuideAdvice:: @ 8180815
	.string "Hey, how's it going, the CHAMPION-\n"
	.string "bound {PLAYER}?\p"
	.string "WATTSON, the LEADER of MAUVILLE\n"
	.string "GYM, uses ELECTRIC-type DIGIMON.\p"
	.string "If you challenge him with WATER-type\n"
	.string "DIGIMON, he'll zap them! Bzzt!\p"
	.string "And, he's put in switch-controlled doors\n"
	.string "all over his GYM! Eccentric!\p"
	.string "Hey, go for it!$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_GymGuidePostVictory:: @ 818091D
	.string "Whoa, you're electrifying!\n"
	.string "You've powered the door open!$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_KirkIntro:: @ 8180956
	.string "My electric soul, it'll shatter your\n"
	.string "dreams whole, whoah-yeahah!$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_KirkDefeat:: @ 8180997
	.string "That was plugged in, amped up,\n"
	.string "over-driven electric, man!$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_KirkPostBattle:: @ 81809D1
	.string "DIGIMON and rock, it's all about heart,\n"
	.string "whoah yeah!$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_ShawnIntro:: @ 8180A05
	.string "I trained under WATTSON!\n"
	.string "There ain't no way I'd lose easily!$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_ShawnDefeat:: @ 8180A42
	.string "Unplugged and turned off...$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_ShawnPostBattle:: @ 8180A5E
	.string "WATTSON, our GYM LEADER, has been\n"
	.string "around for a long, long time.\p"
	.string "He was battling even before your\n"
	.string "daddy was born, that tough coot.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_BenIntro:: @ 8180AE0
	.string "This GYM's got puzzles!\n"
	.string "Isn't it fun?$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_BenDefeat:: @ 8180B06
	.string "It's no fun to lose...$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_BenPostBattle:: @ 8180B1D
	.string "WATTSON says he likes setting up\n"
	.string "little traps with switches.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_VivianIntro:: @ 8180B5A
	.string "With my charm and my DIGIMON's moves,\n"
	.string "you'll be shocked!$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_VivianDefeat:: @ 8180B93
	.string "I'm shocked by your power!$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_VivianPostBattle:: @ 8180BAE
	.string "I've heard that MAUVILLE was founded\n"
	.string "by WATTSON.\p"
	.string "He was a TRAINER long before we\n"
	.string "became TRAINERS.\l"
	.string "He must know all sorts of things!$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_WattsonIntro:: @ 8180C32
	.string "WATTSON: I guard the DYNAMO KEY,\n"
	.string "one of eight locks on the way\p"
	.string "home.\p"
	.string "Your bond must withstand this\n"
	.string "world's rules. Show me how you\p"
	.string "and your partner fight together!$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_WattsonDefeat:: @ 8180D64
	.string "WATTSON: Your bond endured. The\n"
	.string "DYNAMO KEY now belongs to you.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedDynamoBadge:: @ 8180DAF
	.string "{PLAYER} received DIGITAL KEY 3:\n"
	.string "DYNAMO!$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_ExplainDynamoBadgeTakeThis:: @ 8180DDA
	.string "The DYNAMO KEY restores access\n"
	.string "to ROCK SMASH outside battle.\p"
	.string "Its other battle permissions\n"
	.string "remain active.\p"
	.string "This technique will help you\n"
	.string "cross the damaged world. Take it\p"
	.string "with you.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_ExplainShockWave:: @ 8180E76
	.string "That TM34 there contains SHOCK WAVE.\p"
	.string "It's a trustworthy move that never\n"
	.string "misses! You can count on it!$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_WattsonPostBattle:: @ 8180EDB
	.string "You have the DYNAMO KEY. Keep\n"
	.string "seeking the remaining guardians.\p"
	.string "The gate home needs all eight.\n"
	.string "Your partner is your anchor; do\p"
	.string "not lose hope.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_WattsonGoForthAndEndeavor:: @ 8180F1D
	.string "Wahahahah!\n"
	.string "Go forth and endeavor, youngster!$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue:: @ 8180F4A
	.string "MAUVILLE CITY DIGIMON GYM$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_GymStatueCertified:: @ 8180F64
	.string "MAUVILLE CITY DIGIMON GYM\p"
	.string "WATTSON'S CERTIFIED TRAINERS:\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}$"
